  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNICEF - Barn i r&#xe4;ttsv&#xe4;sendet Irak 2011-2012</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNICEF - Justice for Children Iraq 2011-2012 - Justice for Children in Iraq Unicef</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida support for Unicef country program as part of UNDAF 2011-2014.   Sida support will target Unicef work to raise capacity of Iraqi       authorities to protect children and ensure their rights as set out in the convention on the rights of the child. In addition, Sida support  is targeted specifically at Unicefs work to raise capacity in Iraq to protect children in conflikt with the law</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida-st&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r Unicefs landprogram Irak som &#xe4;r del av UNDAF 2011-2014. St&#xf6;det skall riktas till de delar som handlar om att st&#xe4;rka irakiska  myndigheters kapaciet att skydda barn, fr&#xe4;mja och respektera deras    r&#xe4;ttigehter enligt barnkonventionen. D&#xe4;rtill skall st&#xf6;det specifikt   bidra till &#xf6;kad kapacitet att skydda de  barn som &#xe4;r i konflikt med   lagen.</narrative>
  </description>
